          "description": "The mithril dagger is a power level 6 one-handed melee weapon that can be crafted at a blacksmith's bench.\n\n(Journal) Doric likes to remind Vannaka that you wouldn't find a dwarf making daggers.\n\nAs Doric says, \"it's a very human thing, a dagger. A dwarf never hides their weapon: we're polite enough to show what you're up against. An' you won't find us attacking from the back or sides. No sir, we bonk you from the front.\""
