          "description": "The mithril greataxe is a power level 6 two-handed melee weapon that can be crafted at a blacksmith's bench.\n\n(Journal) In the early years of Dowdun Reach, the concept of a mithril greataxe would have been unthinkable. A big, showy weapon that used large quantities of mithril would have been seen as a betrayal. The Children of Shadows, holding a monopoly on mithril, wanted to present it as a rare metal. At best, the richest on Ashenfall might have a brooch or tiara that sparkled with mithril.\n\nNowadays, Doric can have two greataxes whipped up for you before dinner. Much has changed."
