          "description": "The mithril greatsword is a power level 6 two-handed melee weapon that can be crafted at a blacksmith's bench.\n\n(Journal) \"You see a mithril greatsword, I see a mithril dagger,\" Vannaka would say. He would then pick two up from Doric's forge, one in each hand, and try not to register effort. It was a routine, a little play, between Vannaka and Doric.\n\nThis time, however, the joke was on Vannaka. Doric had made his mam's rock cakes, and folded some mithril round them - one for each hilt.\n\nVannaka wobbled. \"Cripes,\" he said."
