              "value": "5 / 5.4 / Ascension Core (Power Level 5) 1; 6 / 6.8 / Ascension Core (Power Level 6) 1; 7 / 8.3 / Ascension Core (Power Level 7) 1; 8 / 9.8 / Ascension Core (Power Level 8) 1"
