          "description": "Leather body is a power level 2 ranged armour that can be crafted at a crafting table.\n\n(Journal)\nWith a distinct aroma, Leather Armour became very popular with warriors and hunters, as well as a few villagers, but that’s another story. Leather, when properly layered and cured, can turn away both the claws of a beast and the blades of an assailant.\n\nSome craftsmen would create more elaborate armour, trading functionality for impressive style. With the discovery of anima-twisted plants with vibrant hues, new dyes were crafted, allowing for colourful and eye-catching armour. This would prove problematic when attempting to be camouflaged on the hunt. Many a colourful set of armour would be found in tattered shreds in the woods; the owner of the armour lost to the wilds."
