          "description": "Mithril shield is a power level 6 shield that is crafted with a blacksmith's bench.\n\n(Journal)\nDoric insists that you should be able to see your face in a mithril shield. That's the mark of quality: if you can check for rock cakes in your teeth before battle, then you've made a good one.\n\nThere's at least a little science behind that. The more tempered mithril is, the more it reflects. Doric isn't being a narcissist here: he knows what he is doing."
