          "description": "The Magic cape is a Cape of Accomplishment able to be crafted and worn at level 99 Magic. It can be crafted at the mystic forge.\n\nTrimmed version of the cape can be crafted the same way if you have more than one skill at 99.\n\n(Journal)\nCongratulations! You could pull a hat from a rabbit, you're that magical.\n\nNow you have mastered the Magic skill, what will you do next? You could trim your cape, of course. Or you could rise up the rank of another skill.\n\nFor now, take a moment. Enjoy the satisfaction of a completed skill. Well done!\n\n(Journal)\nDouble congratulations! You have achieved a Magic Cape with all the trimmings. Precious few can claim that distinction."
