          "description": "The orange adventurer's cape is a simple yet stylish cape that takes no materials to craft.\n\n(Journal)\nCapes are stylish and protect against the weather. They can be elaborate symbols of stature, or simple cloth to act as a ward against the cold. This cape is the latter.\n\nSimple, elegant, and functional. Worn by adventurers and explorers across Gielinor’s mainland and beyond.\n\nAfter the dragon attack, there are few of these capes worn on Ashenfall. The rest sink beneath the ocean waves, are torn to pieces on the cliff rocks, or have long since burned to ash beneath draconic hate."
