          "description": "Reinforced body is a power level 2 armour piece that can be crafted at a crafting table.\n\n(Journal)\nReinforced leather, designed to withstand powerful attacks. Layers of stiffened leather folded together to strengthen one another, turning singular sheets into a powerful defensive force.\n\nThere was a bountiful supply of leather in Brynmoor, much to the chagrin of cows. Young villagers would craft sturdy leather armour when they trained with the guard. Few villagers would ever make the cut of town guard; the demands were strict, and the discipline required was more than many could handle. Yet, those who made the cut were afforded the utmost respect among the people.\n\nAt least those who were not afflicted by the curse of the Amalgamated."
