          "description": "Umbral Sands cape is a armour piece located in Umbral Sands. Players can find the recipe for this cape in the hills, north-east of the pyramid in the Dunes of Uzzer.\n\n(Journal)\nReminisce on all the times that sand got literally everywhere. In your shoes. In your eyes. In your breakfast. This cape is a beautifully embroidered reminder of all the hot sun, scratchy grains, and annoying bugs trying to eat your face.\n\nWear it with pride.\n\n(Journal)\nRunning in sand is one of the hardest things in the world, so take a bow. You've not only mastered Umbral Sands, but you've run about in it, which is something that most of us would try to avoid."
