          "description": "Lesser Focused Fishing potion grants the perk Focused Fishing, which provides a 10-minute (600-second) +15% XP boost for the Fishing skill. It is made with snapdragon, fried sardine, and clay vessel in a brewing cauldron.\n\n(Journal)\nIf you're one of those anglers who exclaim that fishing is 'about taking a load off' and 'more about relaxation than the end-product', then you might want to try a lesser focused fishing potion. It removes the need for excuses and offers a chance of actually catching fish. Your experience grows and you will soon be gathering catches on the regular.\n\nAs an added bonus, with a higher fishing level, you can look down on all the other anglers who claim they fish 'to take a load off'."
