          "description": "An antipoison potion applies the perk Antipoison II, which removes Poison effects and grants 66% resistance from future Poison effects, compared to 33% resistance from Antipoison. It is crafted with irit, poison ichor, and glass vessel.\n\n(Journal)\nJust because you're protected by antipoison, it doesn't mean that you should start glugging poison or poking yourself with poison-tipped arrows. Your body still needs to get rid of that poison, and it's not pleasant on the exit."
