          "description": "Super Focused Artisan potion grants the perk Focused Artisan II, which increased the experience gained through the Artisan skill by 30% for 10 minutes (600 seconds).\n\n(Journal)\nFermented with wild anima, this potion is a concentrated and more powerful version of its predecessor. The effects last longer and yet the power of the potion loses none of its efficiency.\n\nBe warned, after drinking this potion, you may find yourself dreaming of assembling furniture, painting little clay decorations, and a billion other little crafty things that you would never have dreamed of before.\n\nJust beware not to dream of the forbidden macramé, for in its strange knots do dark secrets dwell."
