          "description": "Super Focused Attack potion grants the perk Focused Attack II, which provides a 10-minute (600-second) +30% XP boost for the Attack skill. It is made by using a Focused Attack potion in an imbuing barrel.\n\n(Journal)\nHave you ever wondered what it would be like to know nothing but bloodlust? To know nothing but the call for battle and the need to slaughter?\n\nWell, with this potion, you can! Condensed and fermented alongside wild anima, this potion will flood your system with so much adrenaline and aggression, that you’ll be looking to cause destruction on a catastrophic scale."
