          "description": "Super Focused Construction potion grants the perk Focused Construction II, which provides a 10-minute (600-second) +30% XP boost for the Construction skill. It is made by using a Focused Construction potion in an imbuing barrel.\n\n(Journal)\nAh, to be a zen-like architect, focused on nothing but crenulations and scaffolding. Such thoughts were nought but dreams before this potion, yet now you have a chance to soar to new heights of… err… masonry?\n\nIt’s hard to write about a potion that enhances your desire to build things. To wax lyrical about a liquid that grants greater XP when you craft new decorations and bigger stairs. Yet, here we are."
