          "description": "Super Quarrymaster potion grants the perk Quarrymaster II, which reduces the stamina cost of mining by 66% for 10 minutes (600 seconds).\n\n(Journal)\nA super quarrymaster potion will give you supernatural stamina when it comes to mining rocks, but you should be careful. Potions have the annoying habit of wearing off, and it's only then that you realise you've got killer cramp, pins and needles, or miner's cough. There's no comedown quite like a quarrymaster comedown."
